  <metadata>
    <name>Via Verde del Carrilet</name>
    <desc>The old Carrilet railway converted to a greenway — a smooth gravel track following the Ter valley from Girona to Olot through Anglès and Amer. Largely car-free, gently graded, perfect for exploring inland Catalonia.</desc>
